# Annotation reference creates SCC dependency edge.
# A function annotated with @MyType appears BEFORE the MyType: [type ...] declaration
# in the same dict. The annotation reference in collect_dependencies creates an edge
# MyType <- annotated-fn, ensuring MyType is processed first in the SCC analysis.
[
  annotated-fn: [fn@MyType [let x] [MyType.Ok value: x]]
  MyType: [type Ok: [value: Integer] Error: [msg: String]]
  result: [annotated-fn 42]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Variant(MyType.Ok, {"value": Int(42)})
